  "_comment": "Opendatasoft public event datasets (international civic/community events, geo-tagged). OpenAgenda is the flagship - public community events, hugely rich in France (~29k upcoming) plus real coverage in GB/IE/DE/NL/CA. Filtered to events STARTING within within_days so dates are fresh. France gets its own source (dense) so the sparse target countries aren't crowded out under the offset cap. Add more ODS city datasets as verified: find them at <portal>/api/explore/v2.1/catalog/datasets?where=search(\"events\"). Each source: {domain, dataset, category, within_days, countries (ISO filter), max, map:{...}}. Events carry {lon,lat} so no geocoding.",
